sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer
    participant OrderSvc as order-service
    participant IdentitySvc as identity-service
    participant PromoSvc as promotion-service
    participant PaymentSvc as payment-service
    participant Kafka
    participant InvSvc as inventory-service
    participant PlatformSvc as platform-service

    Buyer->>OrderSvc: POST /orders/checkout (cart, coupon?, cardNumber)
    OrderSvc->>IdentitySvc: GET /accounts/{id} (sync, live buyer-active check)
    IdentitySvc-->>OrderSvc: buyerActive
    break buyer deactivated
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: rejected (account deactivated), nothing started
    end
    OrderSvc->>PromoSvc: GET /coupons/validate (sync)
    PromoSvc-->>OrderSvc: valid, discount amount

    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: create Order (PENDING)
    OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish MerchantChargeRequested (per merchant)
    OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish StockReserveRequested (per product line)

    par For each merchant
        Kafka->>PaymentSvc: MerchantChargeRequested
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: authorize + capture
        alt approved
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantCharged
        else declined
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantDeclined
        end
    and For each product line
        Kafka->>InvSvc: StockReserveRequested
        InvSvc->>InvSvc: Redis EVAL atomic pre-check + decrement
        InvSvc->>InvSvc: Postgres conditional UPDATE + StockReservation (commit)
        alt sufficient stock
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReserved
        else insufficient stock
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReservationFailed
        end
    end

    Kafka->>OrderSvc: all charge results + all reservation results

    alt all merchants charged AND all stock reserved
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = SUCCEEDED
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish OrderSucceeded
        Kafka->>PromoSvc: OrderSucceeded (mark coupon used)
        Kafka->>PlatformSvc: OrderSucceeded (update GMV/commission projection)
        Note over InvSvc: no action needed - stock already<br/>committed at reservation time
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 200 order succeeded
    else at least one declined OR out of stock
        par Compensate charged merchants
            OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish MerchantRefundRequested (per already-charged merchant)
            Kafka->>PaymentSvc: MerchantRefundRequested
            PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: refund
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantRefunded
        and Compensate reserved stock
            OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish StockReleaseRequested (per already-reserved product)
            Kafka->>InvSvc: StockReleaseRequested
            InvSvc->>InvSvc: Postgres delete reservation + increment, then Redis increment
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReleased
        end
        Kafka->>OrderSvc: all refunds + all releases confirmed
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = FAILED
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish OrderFailed
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 200 order failed (reason: declined merchant or out-of-stock line, others auto-reversed)
    end
